h3:chap-sampling-distributions-sim-normal Simulation Setup: Normal Population
fig:sbp-normal-samples Histograms of the first four random samples from a Normal population. The smooth grey density curve corresponds to the population distribution pdf. The blue vertical line segment corresponds to the population mean, while the red vertical line segment corresponds to the sample mean.
tab:echo Sample Means and Standard Deviations for First Four Samples
fig:sbp-normal-sampling-distns Sampling distributions of the sample mean and sample standard deviation (Normal population). The blue vertical line segments correspond to the population parameter values.
