h3:simulation-setup-non-normal-population Simulation Setup: Non-Normal Population
fig:echo Histograms of the first four random samples from a Non-Normal population (mixture of two Normals). The grey curve shows the population pdf. Blue and red vertical line segments indicate the population and sample means, respectively.
fig:sbp-mixture-sampling-distns Sampling distributions of the sample mean and sample standard deviation (mixture population). Blue lines represent the true population mean and SD.

